  data: {
    LLM: "Commit early. If you are dealt two high cards of the same suit (e.g., A and Q of Clubs), discard everything else and hunt for Clubs immediately.\n\nThe Discard Signal: Pay attention to what your opponent discards. If they drop a King of Diamonds, itâ€™s a strong sign they are NOT collecting Diamonds. You can safely build a Diamond hand knowing they likely won't take your discards.\n\nDefensive Discarding: If you know the player to your left is collecting Spades, you should hold onto high Spades even if they don't fit your hand, to prevent them from hitting 41.",
